its 1-5 only | `polybius_dec`; pycipher PolybiusSquare | high: classical keyless grid |\n| 47 | tap code (knock) | prebuilt tgt:polybius (tapcode*) | yes | `..... ..` dot/x groups, K=C grid | `tap_dec` | med-high: \"knock\"/\"prison\" |\n| 48 | Baconian (A/B, 0/1, case stego) | seen D17 (as hex carrier, row 97); letter Bacon prebuilt tgt:bacon (24/26, AB/01, keep, cc) | yes | 5-groups of 2 symbols; case pattern in cover text | `bacon_dec`; chepy from_bacon | med: plain-letter Bacon or case-stego Bacon as a sequel |\n| 49 | Braille (U+2800) | prebuilt tgt:braille (+ braille-ascii) | yes | `⠝⠊⠉⠑`, number sign `⠼` | `braille_dec`; chepy from_braille | med |\n   262 reference/coverage/binary-reverse-engineering.md\n   325 reference/coverage/metadata-forensics.md\n   220 reference/coverage/mobile-android.md\n   224 reference/coverage/script-analysis.md\n   248 reference/coverage/warmups.md\n  1279 total","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01TFT5sL4k9KPNUJ6zSvbWA3","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
